0\u00b0 Live-Streams in 3D - als w\u00e4rst du selbst da \nW\u00e4hle deinen Kamerawinkel jederzeit \n\nRiesige Events in Echtzeit: Bundesliga, Supercup, Festivals u.v.m. \nSprach- und Handsteuerung f\u00fcr maximale Immersion \n  \nBE THERE NOW. ", "short_description": "Sport & Konzerte in 360\u00b0 \u2013 be there now "}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSquare.png", "id": "1656216171741820", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819775_1656216175075153_2895559536759162680_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vWIXbbOo79UQ7kNvwGb_h3O&_nc_oc=AdqiDEmnmxyhofwXuwfPTEKn1TB4m8JQs3YeF8-gFDhcnSeHbj--KM7S722XeauHB4s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ5yBWflW2vUxVDuzoLLDfs4lZOZ2XJyfJtg8yyURG2UA&oe=6AABD956"}, {"file_name": "CoverImagePortrait.png", "id": "1414326893195674", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821107_1414326896529007_8462027792716524313_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4ttPubV0syEQ7kNvwHXFCFd&_nc_oc=AdounihgBU5RPZItV6mLi9ywDJvQcnMshyV3lssfzLl3Cqe6zRH4uTKuZzZ-NdQtleQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIuSywwzSMOvoukrx738lpn0OUHSjH2-SEvO8OvZjhkLg&oe=6AABE32D"}, {"file_name": "L1VE_LOGO.png", "id": "1141925937781157", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822789_1141925944447823_7424494728140263932_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p90fXc90SkEQ7kNvwFbOfCb&_nc_oc=AdrUsNN6QFoKSnPdRW5YUKw_HSRjiduzX7CyOmQQioDN3M6rTW2u8V_jQAN4QwffGkQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIQlCmKxz-SVvVAPzsx_NOLd0XHCzt1XdZ8z3iXdzSB3g&oe=6AABDB6D"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "996045819187461", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820325_996045822520794_3628469034101667116_n.png?_nc_ca